  "Info": {
    "Name": "Scribble Dark",
    "Version": 1.1,
    "Author": "Duong Dieu Phap",
    "Description": "Scribble Dark pairs white chalk lines with cherry-red and violet pencil details on neutral graphite backgrounds. The drawings keep the uneven edges and light hatching of the white-paper version. Its pale \"ig\" logo has a red dot, and the toolbar, gallery, and menus use slightly lighter grays than the viewer."
  },
